{"id":"81ef4cd9-1913-4094-b625-fe02678187dd","rule_id":"494ebba4-ecb7-4be4-8c6f-654c686549ad","name":"【默认】Linux疑似后门账号创建","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":115,"revision":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:42.864Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:13:38.578Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":"检测疑似创建后门本地账号的行为（例如异常 UID 相关操作）。对应需求：新建账号。","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则来源: 默认","用例: 身份与访问审计","对应需求: 新建账号"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"},{"id":"T1136","name":"Create Account","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1136.001","name":"Local Account","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1136/001/"}]}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.args","process.command_line","process.executable","process.parent.name","process.parent.executable","process.parent.command_line","event.action","event.type","agent.id"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":">=9.0.0"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":">=1.18.0"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":">=3.0.0"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":">=1.9.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.action","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"event.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"process.args","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"process.name","type":"keyword","ecs":true}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n疑似后门账号相关操作。\n\n### 为何重要\n常见于持久化。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 检查命令行与 UID 变更。\n2. 核查账号合法性。\n3. 无授权则删除/锁定并取证。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["特殊系统维护需临时调整 UID（极少见）"],"references":["https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/primer-on-persistence-mechanisms"],"risk_score":73,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"high","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\nevent.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"process_started\") and\nprocess.name == \"usermod\" and process.args in (\"-u\", \"--uid\") and process.args == \"0\" and\nprocess.args in (\"-o\", \"--non-unique\")\n"}
